DisplayName: Terraria Image Builder
Description: This mod only converts images into block builds (image -> block pixel art). It does not provide lighting, flight, spawning or area clearing. Recommended companions: HEROsMod (fullbright / build tools) and Better Zoom (camera zoom).

Keybinds: {
	SetOrigin.DisplayName: Set Origin (place a dirt block at your feet)
	StartPause.DisplayName: Start / Pause build
	UndoAll.DisplayName: Undo all placed blocks
}
